WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As we've discussed here,
violent riots erupted

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Charlottesville, Virginia,
this weekend.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here to talk about it is
one of our writers,

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.606 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Amber Ruffin.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:11.678 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey.
-Hey, how are you, Amber?

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, I'm all right.
Hey, Seth.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:15.849 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, everybody.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.250 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, now I -- I planned on
coming out here tonight

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.023 line:92%
to talk about Charlottesville

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:25.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Trump's crazy
press conference.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was going to tell everybody
to take a stand,

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.564
to not be discouraged,
and to keep up the fight.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:32.699 line:92%
And I truly believe that.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:36.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, it's just
too much right now.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.438 line:92%
I have a lot on my race plate.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.572 line:92%
-Yeah, I'm sure it's very hard.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:43.243
-It is, and I bet a lot of
minorities feel the same way.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.477 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-And what way is that?

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.480 line:92%
Tired, but in a black way.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Weary.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tired of people acting
like racism is new.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:54.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tired of people telling me
to see things from both sides.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:57.724
Tired of people asking me if I'm
related to the "Bachelorette"

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.426 size:88% position:44% line:92%
just 'cause she's black.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you're not.
-Second cousins,

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.896 line:92%
but that's not the point.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:03.630 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.166 size:84% position:42%
Black people are coping
with a lot right now.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it's not a sprint,
it's a marathon.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:11.805 size:81% position:41%
And it's important to
take care of yourself.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.906 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, you know what?

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:16.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
Instead, I'm going to take you
to some place new.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
Where are we going?

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To my safe space.
Come on!

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
Let's do it!

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:29.255 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
A safe space?
-Yep.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
A safe space is a place
you can go to where

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's safe to do
whatever you want.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.795 line:92%
You can just be yourself.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
And no ones going to say
or do anything

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.298 line:92%
that makes you uncomfortable.

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:40.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's kind of like Facebook
after you un-friend

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
all the people
from your hometown.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:45.505 line:92%
Welcome to my safe space.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.540 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:51.678 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoa.

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:53.113 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're allowed
to have this here?

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am since I told
everyone it's yours.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.753 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-And they believed you?

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:04.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, they said, "Seth wanted
a poster of Maxine Waters?"

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.626 line:92%
And I said, "Why wouldn't he?"

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:07.727 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And they didn't argue.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:10.897
Being black in America is tough,
and people shouldn't be afraid

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:13.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
to take the time they need
to stay strong.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.702
-So, now that we're here,
are you upset about --

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:16.936 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Garbled speech ]

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.638 line:92%
-Wait, why can't I say it?

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.640 line:92%
-'Cause this is my safe space.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.541 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It won't let you say it.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:23.877 size:84% position:42%
There's a lot of things
you can't do in here.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.945 line:92%
Here, try to touch my hair.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.748 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.217 line:92%
[ Electricity crackling ]

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Whoa.
-Yeah.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:36.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
Margarita?
-Yeah.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are margaritas a black thing?
-No.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.494 line:92%
Margaritas are an Amber thing.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not all black people have
the same safe space,

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
and not everything in here is
a black thing.

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:49.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look, here's a coaster
of Chris Evans.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:49.869 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:53.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's Chris Pine.
-Chris something, he's cute.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.976 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I mean, this is great.

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.778 line:92%
I wish I had a safe space.

00:02:58.778 --> 00:02:59.913 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Seth, you're white.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:03.550 size:81% position:41%
You have a safe space.
It's called America.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is where I can say
and do things that I can't

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.987 line:92%
when white people are around.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:08.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like this.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:12.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sometimes instead of ask,
I say axe!

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:13.560 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's fun. try it.
-Try what?

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:16.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yelling something
you wouldn't yell

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
in front of black people.
-Oh, I don't know.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:21.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Come on.
-Okay.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think Al Sharpton is
a bit much!

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.206 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.207 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-We all do.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:27.707 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:31.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seth, what do you think
of my safe space?

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:32.478 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, this is fun.

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:34.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it kind of just feels
like chillin' out.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:38.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is, but for black people
it has become very hard

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:40.286 size:84% position:42%
to find a place where
you can just chill out.

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:44.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every day there's another
tragedy, another hate crime,

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:44.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
another shooting,

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:47.393
another public mispronunciation
of a black name.

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:51.664
And you need a place where you
can come to, to deal with it.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you need that at work?
-Yeah.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.668
The other day I read a headline
about a little girl

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
who got kicked out of school
for having an afro.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:01.708
And it hit me really hard,
but when I came into the office,

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.076 line:92%
no one had even heard the story.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.912
They were seeing who could
remember how to do the Macarena.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:08.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I came in here,
dealt with my feelings,

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:10.650
went back to the office
and told them that it was

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:14.020
this, this, this, this, this,
this, this, this, this, this,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
this, this.
-♪♪ Hey, Macarena ♪♪

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.325 line:92%
Sorry, I'm a little tipsy.

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:22.762 size:78% position:39%
-It's your first one.
-It's your first one!

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:23.396 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:26.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sorry, I just such a
stressful weekend

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.334 line:92%
with all those neo-napkins.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:31.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sorry, I was trying
to say neo-napkins.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:32.405 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Hey -- what's happening?

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:34.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You can't say the word
you wanted to say in here.

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:37.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my goodness.
Let me try another one.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.112 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
White supermarkets.

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You can't say that either.
-Okay, one more.

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:42.815 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Adolf Hilfiger.

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.984 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:45.785 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's great.

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:48.054 size:78% position:39%
-Safe spaces give you
the energy you need

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
to deal with the
world's bull [ Bleep ].

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:55.395
I look around at my heroes
and the loves of my life...

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:55.928 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
...and I know
that I'm not alone.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.866 line:92%
And if they can do it, so can I.

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow, and you get all that
from your safe space?

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.037 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yup.

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:08.241
Why can't the "Big Bang Theory"
have just one black character?

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:09.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When we have rappers
on the show,

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:12.445
I always worry I'm going
to shake their hands wrong.

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:13.713 line:92%
-I never watched "The Wire."

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:16.949
-I've watched "The Wire" five
times, and it's the first thing

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:17.617 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I tell black people.

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:21.020
-I don't like Rachel Dolezal,
but I would let her do my hair.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.791
-I don't recognize three of
the women in these posters.

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:26.025 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.025 --> 00:05:28.127 line:92%
-All right, I'm recharged.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.896 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's bounce.

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:33.399 line:92%
Bounce means leave and bounce.

00:05:33.399 --> 00:05:34.701 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:37.470
-So, are you ready to talk about
last weekend now?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.038 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Yeah, it makes me sick.

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:41.374
How are we supposed to cope with
all this [ Bleep ]?

00:05:41.374 --> 00:05:42.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyday it's some new --
You know what?

00:05:42.809 --> 00:05:46.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I might need some more
time in my safe space.

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:47.380 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.582 size:84% position:42%
-We'll be right back
with more "Late Night"!

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:53.086 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

